{"1113000":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"女神異聞錄４ 黃金版","steam_appid":1113000,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>數位豪華版<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1113000\/extras\/c72785990a355a3a314f2537247f0251.avif?t=1763530422\" width=616 height=332 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>關於此遊戲<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1113000\/extras\/8c5edeaaddd2b923188611adf230e613.poster.avif?t=1763530422\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1113000\/extras\/8c5edeaaddd2b923188611adf230e613.mp4?t=1763530422\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >稻羽市，位於日本鄉下的一個寧靜小鎮，也是《Persona 4 Golden》中一群正值花樣年華的青少年的活躍舞台。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在這個青春成長故事中，主人翁和他的好友因一連串的連續殺人事件而展開了冒險。快來探索本遊戲的豐富內容，像是與志同道合的朋友邂逅、獲得歸屬感，甚至是面對自己的黑暗面。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1113000\/extras\/ef7fd14934f7f3edb62e58fef4af9bb0.poster.avif?t=1763530422\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1113000\/extras\/ef7fd14934f7f3edb62e58fef4af9bb0.mp4?t=1763530422\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《Persona 4 Golden》中，您會找到有意義的羈絆以及與好友一同經歷的點點滴滴。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"